{"id":23460,"shortDescription":"El cruel y despiadado tirano Ceville gobierna el hermoso reino de Faeryanis. O mejor dicho, gobernaba el hermoso reino de Faeryanis, hasta que su valiente gente se rebeló contra su régimen y lo echó del palacio. La reina de corazón noble Gwendolyn lo sustituyó y gobierna con la ayuda de nobles y sabios consejeros.","developers":["Realmforge Studios"],"publishers":["Assemble Entertainment"],"categories":["Un jugador","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"27 FEB 2009","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/23460?t=1668502176","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007486.600x338.jpg?t=1668502176","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007486.1920x1080.jpg?t=1668502176"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007487.600x338.jpg?t=1668502176","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007487.1920x1080.jpg?t=1668502176"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007488.600x338.jpg?t=1668502176","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007488.1920x1080.jpg?t=1668502176"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007489.600x338.jpg?t=1668502176","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007489.1920x1080.jpg?t=1668502176"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007490.600x338.jpg?t=1668502176","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007490.1920x1080.jpg?t=1668502176"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/23460/0000007491.600x338.jpg?t=1668502176","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it